CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/ae com/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/EventAction
	COMMENT EventAction - one entry of a unit's event hook: eventType (UnitEventType), extraAction (ExtraAction to run), metadata (owning CustomUnitMetadata) and filterTag (CustomTag the unit must have). The int field e (default 1) is left obfuscated. [field names verified from code]
	FIELD a eventType Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/af;
	FIELD b extraAction Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/a/g;
	FIELD c metadata Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/l;
	FIELD d filterTag Lcom/corrodinggames/rts/game/units/custom/g;
